For each of the following tasks, write an algorithm that solves it (3 algorithms in total) using an array of 100 integers:

1. Store 100 numbers.
2. Find the largest and smallest values, and display their values and positions in the array.
3. Count and calculate the sum of all even numbers.

--------------------------------------------------------
A: arreglo de [0..99] de enteros;
--------------------------------------------------------
1)
PARA i:= 0 HASTA 99 HACER
  LEER(A[i]);
FIN_PARA;
--------------------------------------------------------
2) 
min, max:= A[0];           3 6 1 8 2 1 5 8 2

PARA i:= 1 HASTA 99 HACER
  SI A[i] < min ENTONCES
    min:= A[i];
  SINO
    SI A[i] > max ENTONCES
      max:= A[i];
    FS;
  FS;
FP;
--------------------------------------------------------
3)
sum:= 0;
PARA i:= 0 HASTA 99 HACER
  SI A[i] MOD 2 = 0 ENTONCES
    sum:= sum + A[i];
  FS;
FP;


